{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MLNAnnotationViewDragState","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationViewDragState","preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@MLNAnnotationViewDragState"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dragState"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All states are handled automatically when the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/draggable"},{"text":" property is set to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". To perform a custom animation in response to a change to this property,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"override the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/setDragState:animated:","isActive":true},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/dragState","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview\/dragstate"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"dragSta